Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:12.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Soon, this flight 210 will arrive on Venus.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some people may have an allergic reaction to{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the floating plants used\Nin the terraforming of Venus.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It has a chance of degenerating{\i0}\N{\i1}into Venus-sickness,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:02:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so if symptoms appear,\Nplease consult a doctor immediately.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet down, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Both hands behind your heads! All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'll give you money!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the others, let me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who makes a ruckus\Nends up like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit. Why did this have to be the day...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.71,0:02:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Quietly put\Nboth hands behind your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think we are?! {let bleed?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.87,0:03:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of you, Ms. Bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is 5000?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Special price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not written anywhere up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not to normal residential quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking ya for a favor here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way out there to\Nthe middle of the desert...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't rip me off here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure it gets there! Got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the business. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My share.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I need it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Depositing it at the casino again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than a bank!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She never gives up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need any more pickpockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing... You're really amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that rounded up the\Nhijackers with some amazing moves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you teach me how to move like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it judo? Or kung-fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 520.01 958.67 l 529.34 1068 348 1058.67 333.33 941.33)}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 593.34 958.67 l 604.01 1068 348 1058.67 333.33 941.33)}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 668.01 958.67 l 674.69 1068 348 1058.67 333.33 941.33)}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 742.67 958.67 l 750.68 1068 348 1058.67 333.33 941.33)}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 813.33 945.34 l 824.02 1068 348 1058.67 333.33 941.33)}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 889.33 945.34 l 898.68 1068 348 1058.67 333.33 941.33)}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 961.33 937.34 l 972.01 1068 348 1058.67 333.33 941.33)}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be strong, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an annoying guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.37,0:05:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A no is a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Just a little. Please, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Come on, just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as helping me. You got\Na little bit of mercy in ya, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.20,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of that right now. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please, it's not\Nlike you're losing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it alrea—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus has a lot of helium\Nin the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fix it quickly with some medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Come on, that's not fair! Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just a throat drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hands-on training?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Roco Bonnaro.\NNice meeting you, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first income in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to the mastermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.03,0:06:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to not tense up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't defeat enemies that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The flow is more important... not power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be like water. {original: "You have to be like the water."}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, come after me with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tensing up anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just using your excessive force. {nearly 13 frame link}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I control the flow of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to relax the whole body to\Nbe able to react to any movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.31,0:07:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I become like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Water can take any form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It can flow along slowly or\Nbeat down aggressively, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno if I get it or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You should take care of your elders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, hold this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight... No, tomorrow night. At the\Ncathedral on the outskirts of this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.07,0:08:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!\NDon't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Casino?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones around here are\Nfamous for being stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. It's not our money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of it, she takes off like a bullet\Nand we don't know when she gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no use wasting time.\NHow about making some pocket cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Piccaro Calvino.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually a stingy little thief,\Nbut went in big this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Price is doubled if we get the whole crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the stolen goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes the remedy for Venus-sickness,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but apparently it's hard to grow them\Nand they're worth tens of millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, he's sure good at running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's worth much more\Nthan nabbing that group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you thought for a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! It's better to not be involved\Nwith dangerous stuff like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay if they don't find out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how much did you lose at the casino?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave Piccaro up to you.\NI'm going after Roco.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:10:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why don't you wait?\NYou're gonna see him anyway. {added the "Huh?" to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that Lady Bounty only has bangs. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.59,0:10:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Lady Luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remains of a shuttle? Why in such a place?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There might be some weirdos that do{\i0}\N{\i1}live out in the desert, but still...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Both hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nobody suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me sound even\Nmore suspicious, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came here to see Roco.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... Roco's friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.11,0:12:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, make sure you wash your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't find him, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's all because\Nof those floating plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they send spores\Nthat look like snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people are fine, but my\Nbody isn't... and my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it inconvenient? {9 frames though could be less if you start on that fainter beginning}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No. It's not a big deal once\Nyou get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you understand\Nmore when you can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If I put money into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind staying as is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but Roco...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He cares about his little sister. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Roco sent me this yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone says bad things about him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And he seems to hang out\Nwith some bad people...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But Roco is a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be one of those\Nbad people he hangs out with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe. Maybe you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.05,0:13:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Both you and Roco have\Nsomething beautiful deep in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.38,0:13:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to tell, but it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it. That's why\NI'm offering you tea like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something beautiful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I probably lost that long, long ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Piccaro. Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I remember now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The price of a gray ash seed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool. Those things are like gems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky if you ever see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it might be difficult to\Nsell them once you get them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but I would say 8 million each.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought not...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Piccaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw up on your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, little Roco.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be nice and tell us where the pot is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to tell us...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That ain't gonna work, is it? {normal lead-out or end just before the punch?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My little Roco.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that you have a little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-She has nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Then where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Piccaro. Tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hyu don'f haff to be so suhhen—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can'f breef...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.05,0:16:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I brought it, like you told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I snuck a peek inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grey ash. Something\Nspectacular unlike its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's 10 times\Nthe bounty placed on all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a bounty hunter, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to nab me? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stella needs this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, or you'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?! I was just\Nsent on some wild goose chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Jet! Are you listening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stop, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The grey ash is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let him go. I'm asking ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you deliver\Nit all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I give my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of him. Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Piccaro Calvino!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't she be a little more elegant?! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't kill them!\NYa trying to kill our bounty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounty hunters?\NGet that thing back, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Roco!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Roco!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Really, you've caused me enough trouble.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hang on! You alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.62,0:19:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Master... did you... see that right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Don't speak anymore.\NI'll call a doctor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have... a favor...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.55,0:19:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the music box...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Leave Stella to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.03,0:19:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, hold on.\NNow, don't die. Don't die! {13 frame snap}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... if I knew you earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,would we... have been friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Roco?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.23,0:20:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Roco?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Roco got me some grey ash!\NAnd the operation fees!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They told me my eyes will be better!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful? What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Roco first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, tell him to come here right now!\NTo hurry over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he... get caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why isn't Roco coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right... Leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Roco died because he\Ndid something bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, leave me for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I never got to see Roco\Nonce with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was Roco really like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know without looking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.35,0:21:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the one you knew.
