Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:48.13,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.39,0:23:48.13,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting next week, Ed will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.47,0:24:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Edward Wong Hau Pepelu\NTivrusky the fourth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.58,0:24:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a long name...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.14,0:24:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I made that name up myself!\NIsn't it cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.71,0:24:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, what do\Nyou mean "the fourth"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Next Episode: Jamming with Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.73,0:24:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, anyway... who is this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.03,0:24:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
